{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "五"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已下前諸文具故不說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一名天台法門論"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "則"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "育材"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一作者"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一無莫字"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一作惡"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "泥一作漏"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "天一作杳"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一作無目日光明"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一作失"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梁君刪定止觀，撰統例以繫其後，猶王輔嗣注易之有略例也。今刊私擢於前，欲披閱者預識\n\n綱紀，臨文隢然，修習無滯。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一作弘"}
