{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "元本第三卷終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "元本第四\n卷終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "觀所發境"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "元本第五卷終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "闕"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "闕"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "闕"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "闕大意，中撮十章，略為五意。第三感大果，推而廣之，見此果報之旨。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "闕大意五，略第四，裂大網及攝法中攝一切教，推而廣之，見此起教之旨。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "闕大意五，略第五歸大處，推而廣之，見此指歸之旨。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "未田地與商那、和修同時，\n故一云二十四人"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "《刪定止觀》（日本東洋大學附屬圖書館哲學堂文庫藏刊本第5圖第3行）"}
